ype=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">The Yin Yoga Guide<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">As your Yin Yoga Guide, I facilitate deep release. Through gentle, sustained floor postures, we compassionately target the dense connective tissues of the body. This quiet, meditative practice cultivates profound stillness, enhances flexibility, and teaches the transformative power of surrender, restoring balance from the inside out.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Yoga Practices for Every Body \u2014 South Delhi&#8217;s Most Complete Studio Not all yoga is the same. And not all bodies need the same practice. At Yoga Inner Power in South Delhi, we offer five distinct yoga disciplines \u2014 each with its own rhythm, intention, and healing potential. Whether you&#8217;re a complete beginner or an experienced practitioner, whether you want to build strength, release stress, or awaken something deeper \u2014 you&#8217;ll find your practice here. Whether you&#8217;re a beginner or a seasoned yogi, our sessions guide you to a healthier body and a centered mind. One breath at a time. Choose the Yoga Style That Fits Your Life Our South Delhi yoga classes are designed to be genuinely accessible. No prior experience needed for Hatha or Yin. No particular fitness level required to begin. Just show up, breathe, and let Shikha Arya guide the rest. All classes are available as private sessions (including home visits across South Delhi) or as structured courses. For Your Unique Needs Want to exercise but don\u2019t like the gym? Your coach will train you 1-on-1 with a personalized fitness Book a Session Desk work causing aches and pains? Back (lower back, nerve p